---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About Me</h1>

		<div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
			<p>
				Hello, I'm Saikrishna Nagisetti, a passionate technologist and the
				creator of TechStart.Cloud.
			</p>

			<p>
				I have extensive experience in web development, cloud computing, and
				software engineering. My goal is to share knowledge and insights through
				this blog to help others in their tech journey.
			</p>

			<h2>Background</h2>
			<p>
				With over [X] years in the industry, I've worked with various
				technologies and frameworks. My expertise includes:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Full-stack web development</li>
				<li>Cloud architecture and deployment</li>
				<li>DevOps practices and tools</li>
				<li>Performance optimization</li>
				<li>Technical writing and documentation</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Why TechStart.Cloud?</h2>
			<p>
				I created this blog to document my learning journey and share valuable
				insights with the community. Here, you'll find tutorials, guides, best
				practices, and thought pieces on various tech topics.
			</p>

			<h2>Connect With Me</h2>
			<p>
				I'm always open to interesting conversations and collaboration
				opportunities. Feel free to reach out through any of the social
				platforms linked in the footer or via email at
				<a href="mailto:contact@techstart.cloud">contact@techstart.cloud</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
